    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kokushi: lost island\u00a0</i>is a <strong>pure-exploration adventure</strong> with no combat and no quest log. You wander a living island alone, where time never stops, searching for <strong>fourteen mah-jong tiles</strong> to complete the legendary <i>Kokushi Musou</i> hand.<br>\u27a4 <i>Each play session takes around 10 to 20 minutes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/b4233742f8967fe4d6868f8d76f6286c.poster.avif?t=1752756632\" width=512 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/b4233742f8967fe4d6868f8d76f6286c.webm?t=1752756632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/b4233742f8967fe4d6868f8d76f6286c.mp4?t=1752756632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Guide UI \u2014 Always Know What to Collect</strong><br>The on-screen <i>Musou Gauge</i> highlights every missing tile, so you can focus on exploration. Even players who know nothing about mah-jong can enjoy the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/3394420c883c72326c5ad70b3657d6d6.poster.avif?t=1752756632\" width=512 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/3394420c883c72326c5ad70b3657d6d6.webm?t=1752756632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/3394420c883c72326c5ad70b3657d6d6.mp4?t=1752756632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Beware the Sunset</strong><br>Exploration isn\u2019t unlimited. Time advances in real-time, and the island is swallowed by darkness when the sun goes down. Gather all fourteen tiles <strong>before night falls</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kokushi: lost island\u00a0</i>is a <strong>pure-exploration adventure</strong> with no combat and no quest log. You wander a living island alone, where time never stops, searching for <strong>fourteen mah-jong tiles</strong> to complete the legendary <i>Kokushi Musou</i> hand.<br>\u27a4 <i>Each play session takes around 10 to 20 minutes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/b4233742f8967fe4d6868f8d76f6286c.poster.avif?t=1752756632\" width=512 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/b4233742f8967fe4d6868f8d76f6286c.webm?t=1752756632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/b4233742f8967fe4d6868f8d76f6286c.mp4?t=1752756632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Guide UI \u2014 Always Know What to Collect</strong><br>The on-screen <i>Musou Gauge</i> highlights every missing tile, so you can focus on exploration. Even players who know nothing about mah-jong can enjoy the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/3394420c883c72326c5ad70b3657d6d6.poster.avif?t=1752756632\" width=512 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/3394420c883c72326c5ad70b3657d6d6.webm?t=1752756632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834720/extras/3394420c883c72326c5ad70b3657d6d6.mp4?t=1752756632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p cla